    - target: {fileID: 2127842040194719528, guid: aadb2b42a8950914787643598a4db751, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Light
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4844587605343904853, guid: aadb2b42a8950914787643598a4db751, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Light is the energetic half of the classical Aether, occupying the higher end of the Axis of Spirit. Luminosity is the closest mortals come to touching the stars, and as such it is often used as a magnifier, concentrating the four natural elements. The crystals of earth in particular, with its intrinsic stabilizing order, are useful for directing and focusing its energy.



        In small doses, light simply illuminates the world, showing things as they are with shining serenity, even that which cannot normally be seen. Truth so loves to be brought into the light, exposing falsehoods in its glow. In excess, light destabilizes into a bright prism of the natural elements, revealing their true origin and composition therein.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5422127031761078480, guid: aadb2b42a8950914787643598a4db751, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: The Element of Light
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
